      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "THE PROBLEM Knowing the content is not enough Cambridge gives marks for specific things: the working, the application, the explanation that links back to the question. Students who study hard but write loosely lose those marks and do not see where they went. 01 Right answer, marks missing You reach the answer, but the mark scheme also wanted the working, the application or the link back to the question. 02 Papers done, never marked You practise past papers without a mark scheme in hand, so you cannot see which line lost the mark. 03 The question left unasked The basic question that felt too sm",
